WEBVTT

00:07:29.445 --> 00:07:31.071
it's those algorithms,

00:07:31.071 --> 00:07:33.449
screen time is a technology.

00:07:35.201 --> 00:07:38.787
But an anthropologist called Danah Boyd
went out a few years ago

00:07:38.829 --> 00:07:43.792
and tried to look at teenagers
"in the wild" with their cell phones,

00:07:43.834 --> 00:07:45.169
(Laughter)

00:07:45.169 --> 00:07:47.254
and realized that when
you observe teenagers

00:07:47.296 --> 00:07:50.966
with this kind of broad
anthropological perspective,

00:07:50.966 --> 00:07:53.093
when you try and look
with a worm's eye view,

00:07:53.093 --> 00:07:55.012
not a bird's eye view,

00:07:55.012 --> 00:07:58.224
actually, there's something
about teenagers that's quite remarkable.

00:07:58.265 --> 00:08:01.018
Which is that 50, 100 years ago,